{"content_hash": "19ac69bcb63945e2", "version_id": 743, "article_id": 75, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Crowd of 50 beats foreigner to death in Durban", "title_zh": "德班约50人围殴一名外国人致死", "has_translation": true, "topic": "world", "source": "bbc_world", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck5yn9z3vnego?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1623438744990-f47414813a29?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8Y3Jvd2QlMjBiZWF0cyUyMGZvcmVpZ25lcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkyNzEzOTg0fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Amir Arabshahi on Unsplash", "author": "Amir Arabshahi", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@amir_arabshahi?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-crowd-of-people-with-their-hands-in-the-air-ERSKz8OrZIQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(69, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(107, 46%, 48%)", "label": "WORLD", "seed": "d8d50814b11f"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-23", "word_count": 184, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "Police in South Africa say a crowd of about 50 people beat a foreign man to death in Durban. The killing comes after months of protests against immigrants, some of which turned violent.", "lead_zh": "南非警方称，德班约50人围殴一名外籍男子致死。这起事件发生之前，当地已持续数月爆发反移民抗议，部分抗议演变为暴力。", "preview": "Police said the man was attacked by the roadside. Two men approached him first, and then a larger group joined the assault. He was pronounce", "preview_zh": "警方称，这名男子在路边遭到袭击。两名男子先靠近他，随后更多人加入殴打。他被当场宣布死亡。警方认为他年近四十或四十出头，但姓名尚不清楚。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 731, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/75/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 65.95, "size_bytes": 396720, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 209, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/75/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 67.175, "size_bytes": 404064, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 209, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/75/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/75/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 71.725, "size_bytes": 431280, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 209, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/75/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/75/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 61.625, "size_bytes": 370656, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 209, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/75/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/75/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 66.275, "size_bytes": 398592, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 209, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/75/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@5eaba37/content/data/versions/743.json", "paragraphs": ["Police said the man was attacked by the roadside. Two men approached him first, and then a larger group joined the assault. He was pronounced dead at the scene. Officers believe he was in his late 30s or early 40s, although his name is not yet known.", "Police have opened a murder investigation, but the motive is not clear. A police spokesperson told the BBC that they cannot guess why the man was killed. He added that more details would be shared once they are checked and confirmed.", "The killing follows a wave of anti-immigrant protests in South Africa this year. Earlier this month, crowds set shops and cars on fire in Durban and in Soweto, near Johannesburg. The government has asked protesters to stay peaceful, although it accepts that immigration rules need reform.", "South Africa has struggled with xenophobic attacks for nearly two decades. In 2008, more than 60 people were killed and tens of thousands were displaced. Poverty, inequality and high unemployment make life hard, so many people blame migrants for taking jobs, although researchers say the evidence does not support this."], "paragraphs_zh": ["警方称，这名男子在路边遭到袭击。两名男子先靠近他，随后更多人加入殴打。他被当场宣布死亡。警方认为他年近四十或四十出头，但姓名尚不清楚。", "警方已就谋杀案展开调查，但作案动机尚不明确。一名警方发言人告诉BBC，他们无法猜测这名男子为何被杀。他还说，更多细节将在核实确认后公布。", "这起事件发生前，南非今年已出现一波反移民抗议。本月早些时候，德班和约翰内斯堡附近的索韦托有商店和汽车被纵火焚烧。政府呼吁抗议者保持和平，同时也承认移民制度需要改革。", "近二十年来，南非一直难以摆脱排外袭击。2008年，超过60人在大范围袭击外国人事件中丧生，数万人流离失所。贫困、不平等和高失业率让生活艰难，因此许多人指责移民抢走工作，尽管研究人员表示证据并不支持这种说法。"], "body": "Police said the man was attacked by the roadside. Two men approached him first, and then a larger group joined the assault. He was pronounced dead at the scene. Officers believe he was in his late 30s or early 40s, although his name is not yet known.\n\nPolice have opened a murder investigation, but the motive is not clear. A police spokesperson told the BBC that they cannot guess why the man was killed. He added that more details would be shared once they are checked and confirmed.\n\nThe killing follows a wave of anti-immigrant protests in South Africa this year. Earlier this month, crowds set shops and cars on fire in Durban and in Soweto, near Johannesburg. The government has asked protesters to stay peaceful, although it accepts that immigration rules need reform.\n\nSouth Africa has struggled with xenophobic attacks for nearly two decades. In 2008, more than 60 people were killed and tens of thousands were displaced. Poverty, inequality and high unemployment make life hard, so many people blame migrants for taking jobs, although researchers say the evidence does not support this.", "body_zh": "警方称，这名男子在路边遭到袭击。两名男子先靠近他，随后更多人加入殴打。他被当场宣布死亡。警方认为他年近四十或四十出头，但姓名尚不清楚。\n\n警方已就谋杀案展开调查，但作案动机尚不明确。一名警方发言人告诉BBC，他们无法猜测这名男子为何被杀。他还说，更多细节将在核实确认后公布。\n\n这起事件发生前，南非今年已出现一波反移民抗议。本月早些时候，德班和约翰内斯堡附近的索韦托有商店和汽车被纵火焚烧。政府呼吁抗议者保持和平，同时也承认移民制度需要改革。\n\n近二十年来，南非一直难以摆脱排外袭击。2008年，超过60人在大范围袭击外国人事件中丧生，数万人流离失所。贫困、不平等和高失业率让生活艰难，因此许多人指责移民抢走工作，尽管研究人员表示证据并不支持这种说法。", "text": "Police said the man was attacked by the roadside. Two men approached him first, and then a larger group joined the assault. He was pronounced dead at the scene. Officers believe he was in his late 30s or early 40s, although his name is not yet known. Police have opened a murder investigation, but the motive is not clear. A police spokesperson told the BBC that they cannot guess why the man was killed. He added that more details would be shared once they are checked and confirmed. The killing follows a wave of anti-immigrant protests in South Africa this year. Earlier this month, crowds set shops and cars on fire in Durban and in Soweto, near Johannesburg. The government has asked protesters to stay peaceful, although it accepts that immigration rules need reform. South Africa has struggled with xenophobic attacks for nearly two decades. In 2008, more than 60 people were killed and tens of thousands were displaced. Poverty, inequality and high unemployment make life hard, so many people blame migrants for taking jobs, although researchers say the evidence does not support this.", "vocab": [{"word": "beat to death", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "殴打致死", "note": "常见新闻表达，beat-beat-beaten", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "foreign national", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "外籍人士", "note": "比 foreigner 更正式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "assault", "pos": "noun", "zh": "袭击；殴打", "note": "也可作动词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pronounced dead", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "被宣布死亡", "note": "医疗和警方常用说法", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "motive", "pos": "noun", "zh": "动机", "note": "调查类新闻高频词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "investigation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "调查", "note": "搭配 launch/open an investigation", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "protest", "pos": "noun", "zh": "抗议", "note": "动词同形，重音在后", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "set on fire", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "纵火焚烧", "note": "被动 set on fire", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "xenophobic", "pos": "adj", "zh": "排外的；仇外的", "note": "名词为 xenophobia", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "displaced", "pos": "adj", "zh": "被迫离开家园的", "note": "常与 people 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-23T00:06:23.045368", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Police", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.55, "sm": 250, "em": 550, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "said", "s": 0.55, "e": 0.712, "sm": 550, "em": 712, "cs": 7, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "the", "s": 0.713, "e": 0.8, "sm": 712, "em": 800, "cs": 12, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "man", "s": 0.8, "e": 1.062, "sm": 800, "em": 1062, "cs": 16, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "was", "s": 1.062, "e": 1.175, "sm": 1062, "em": 1175, "cs": 20, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "attacked", "s": 1.175, "e": 1.625, "sm": 1175, "em": 1625, "cs": 24, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "by", "s": 1.625, "e": 1.762, "sm": 1625, "em": 1762, "cs": 33, "ce": 35, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "the", "s": 1.762, "e": 1.85, "sm": 1762, "em": 1849, "cs": 36, "ce": 39, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "roadside", "s": 1.85, "e": 2.775, "sm": 1850, "em": 2774, "cs": 40, "ce": 48, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": ".", "s": 2.775, "e": 2.913, "sm": 2775, "em": 2912, "cs": 48, "ce": 49, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "Two", "s": 2.913, "e": 3.125, "sm": 2912, "em": 3124, "cs": 50, "ce": 53, "si": 1}, {"i": 11, "w": "men", "s": 3.125, "e": 3.35, "sm": 3125, "em": 3350, "cs": 54, "ce": 57, "si": 1}, {"i": 12, "w": "approached", "s": 3.35, "e": 3.663, "sm": 3350, "em": 3662, "cs": 58, "ce": 68, "si": 1}, {"i": 13, "w": "him", "s": 3.663, "e": 3.837, "sm": 3662, "em": 3837, "cs": 69, "ce": 72, "si": 1}, {"i": 14, "w": "first", "s": 3.837, "e": 4.425,